qisiTV changes
--------------

qisiTV adds LikeAI protocol support, a shared local MCP and CLI interface,
external Agent task writeback, canvas synchronization and the qisiTV identity.
Historical upstream demonstrations are retained under assets/upstream/ and
are not presented as current qisiTV interface screenshots.
